    <briefdescription>
<para>A proxy object for computing a reference via indirecting a copy of an iterator. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is used in APIs which need to produce a reference via indirection but for which the iterator object might be a temporary. The proxy preserves the iterator internally and exposes the indirected reference via a conversion operator. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
